#: resources/animate.glade:440
msgid ""
"<b>Color and segment scale</b> <i>— currents, charges, and fields shade the "
"model</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Rang va segment masshtabi</b> <i>— toklar, zaryadlar va maydonlar modelni "
"boʻyaydi</i>"

#: resources/animate.glade:481
msgid "None (geometry)"
msgstr "Yoʻq (geometriya)"

#: resources/animate.glade:485
msgid "Show the bare structure geometry with no quantity coloring."
msgstr "Hech qanday miqdor rangisiz sof tuzilma geometriyasini koʻrsatish."

#: resources/animate.glade:498 resources/xnec2c.glade:11223
msgid "Currents"
msgstr "Toklar"

#: resources/animate.glade:502
msgid "Animate current magnitude and direction along the wires."
msgstr "Simlardagi tok kattaligi va yoʻnalishini animatsiya qilish."

#: resources/animate.glade:515 resources/xnec2c.glade:11238
msgid "Charges"
msgstr "Zaryadlar"

#: resources/animate.glade:519
msgid "Animate charge magnitude along the wires."
msgstr "Simlar boʻylab zaryad kattaligini animatsiya qilish."

#: resources/animate.glade:542
msgid "_Polarization:"
msgstr "_Qutblanish:"

#: resources/animate.glade:557
msgid ""
"Select the polarization component used by radiation-pattern gain and far-"
"zone animation vectors.\n"
"\n"
"Mirrors the polarization selection in the main, radiation-pattern, and "
"frequency-plot windows.\n"
"\n"
"Hovering an entry previews it live."
msgstr ""
"Nurlanish diagrammasi kuchaytirishi va uzoq maydon animatsiya vektorlari "
"tomonidan ishlatiladigan qutblanish komponentini tanlang.\n"
"\n"
"Asosiy, nurlanish diagrammasi va chastota grafigi oynalaridagi qutblanish "
"tanlovini kuzatib boradi.\n"
"\n"
"Yozuv ustiga sichqonchani olib borish uni jonli koʻrsatib beradi."

#: resources/animate.glade:630
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Koʻrsatish"

#: resources/animate.glade:668
msgid "Flow direction:"
msgstr "Oqim yoʻnalishi:"

#: resources/animate.glade:747
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "Patchlar"

#: resources/animate.glade:782
msgid "Near E field"
msgstr "Yaqin E maydoni"

#: resources/animate.glade:797
msgid "Near H field"
msgstr "Yaqin H maydoni"

#: resources/animate.glade:812
msgid "Poynting vector"
msgstr "Poyinting vektori"

#: resources/animate.glade:851
msgid "Near Field"
msgstr "Yaqin maydon"

#: resources/animate.glade:886
msgid "Far E field"
msgstr "Uzoq E maydoni"

#: resources/animate.glade:890
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone electric field as arrows tangent to the gain surface while "
"animating.\n"
"\n"
"Enable by opening the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Uzoq zonadagi elektr maydonni animatsiya paytida kuchaytirish sirtiga urinma "
"boʻlgan koʻrsatkichlar sifatida chizing.\n"
"\n"
"Uni yoqish uchun nurlanish diagrammasi oynasini oching."

#: resources/animate.glade:903
msgid "Far H field"
msgstr "Uzoq H maydoni"

#: resources/animate.glade:907
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone magnetic field instead, a quarter turn from the electric "
"field in the tangent plane and in step with it in time.\n"
"\n"
"Enable by opening the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Buning oʻrniga uzoq zonadagi magnit maydonni chizing, u urinma tekislikda "
"elektr maydondan choraklik burilgan va vaqt boʻyicha u bilan uygʻun.\n"
"\n"
"Uni yoqish uchun nurlanish diagrammasi oynasini oching."

#: resources/animate.glade:920
msgid "World reference"
msgstr "Dunyoviy tayanch"

#: resources/animate.glade:936
msgid "Ludwig-3 reference"
msgstr "Ludwig-3 tayanchi"

#: resources/animate.glade:961
msgid "Arrow:"
msgstr "Oʻq:"

#: resources/animate.glade:978
msgid ""
"Longest arrow a cell draws, as a fraction of that cell's own pattern radius, "
"so the arrows track whichever gain scale shapes the surface."
msgstr ""
"Har bir katak chizadigan eng uzun koʻrsatkich shu katakning oʻz diagramma "
"radiusiga nisbatan ulush sifatida beriladi, shunda koʻrsatkichlar sirtni "
"shakllantiruvchi har qanday kuchaytirish masshtabiga mos keladi."

#: resources/animate.glade:1020
msgid "Far Field"
msgstr "Uzoq maydon"

#: resources/animate.glade:1038
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone field as tangent vectors on the radiation pattern gain "
"surface while this window is open."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu oyna ochiq boʻlgan vaqtda uzoq maydonni nurlanish diagrammasi "
"kuchaytirish yuzasida urinma vektorlar sifatida chizing."

