#: resources/xnec2c.glade:9859
msgid ""
"Plots the precision lost solving the antenna at each frequency, in decimal "
"digits.\n"
"Values appear once a frequency sweep has produced results.\n"
"Read it against the impedance and VSWR traces: a flat low curve means those "
"traces are sound, while a peak marks a frequency where the solve degraded, "
"so a sharp impedance excursion at that same frequency is a numerical "
"artefact rather than a resonance.\n"
"A double carries about 15 digits, so a reading of 3 leaves 12 sound ones and "
"a reading near 15 leaves none; shorten or thicken the offending segments and "
"run the sweep again to bring the curve down."
msgstr ""
"Har bir chastotada antennani yechishda yoʻqolgan aniqlikni oʻnlik xonalarda "
"chizadi.\n"
"Chastota sikli natijalar bergandan soʻng qiymatlar paydo boʻladi.\n"
"Uni impedans va VSWR chiziqlariga qarshi oʻqing: tekis past egri chiziq bu "
"chiziqlarning ishonchli ekanini bildiradi, choʻqqi esa yechim yomonlashgan "
"chastotani belgilaydi, shu sababli xuddi shu chastotadagi keskin impedans "
"siljishi rezonans emas, balki sonli artefaktdir.\n"
"Double taxminan 15 xonani saqlaydi, shuning uchun 3 koʻrsatkichi 12 ta "
"ishonchli xonani qoldiradi, 15 ga yaqin koʻrsatkich esa birortasini ham "
"qoldirmaydi; egri chiziqni pasaytirish uchun muammoli segmentlarni "
"qisqartiring yoki qalinlashtiring va siklni qayta ishga tushiring."

