#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:64
msgid ""
"Choose how current flow is marked on surface patches.\n"
"This model has no patches: add SP, SC, or SM patch cards to the NEC input "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Sirt patchlarida tok oqimi qanday belgilanishini tanlang.\n"
"Bu modelda patchlar yoʻq: NEC kirish fayliga SP, SC yoki SM patch "
"kartalarini qoʻshing."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:72
msgid ""
"Choose which near-field quantity is drawn as animated vectors.\n"
"This model carries no near field: add NE or NH cards to the NEC input file."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi yaqin maydon miqdori animatsiyali vektorlar sifatida chizilishini "
"tanlang.\n"
"Bu model yaqin maydonga ega emas: NEC kirish fayliga NE yoki NH kartalarini "
"qoʻshing."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:76
msgid ""
"Choose which near-field quantity is drawn as animated vectors.\n"
"In the main window choose View, Radiation Pattern, then in that window "
"select E/H Fields."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi yaqin maydon miqdori animatsiyali vektorlar sifatida chizilishini "
"tanlang.\n"
"Asosiy oynada Koʻrish, Nurlanish diagrammasi bandini tanlang, soʻngra oʻsha "
"oynada E/H maydonlarini tanlang."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:84
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone field as arrows on the gain surface.\n"
"In the main window choose View, Radiation Pattern; if that item is disabled, "
"add an RP card to the NEC input file."
msgstr ""
"Uzoq maydonni kuchaytirish yuzasida oʻqlar sifatida chizing.\n"
"Asosiy oynada View, Radiation Pattern-ni tanlang; agar bu band oʻchirilgan "
"boʻlsa, NEC kirish fayliga RP kartasini qoʻshing."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:88
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone field as arrows on the gain surface.\n"
"Tick the check box in the Far Field heading just above."
msgstr ""
"Uzoq maydonni kuchaytirish yuzasida oʻqlar sifatida chizing.\n"
"Yuqoridagi Far Field sarlavhasidagi katakchani belgilang."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:95
msgid ""
"Choose the reference the vertical and horizontal gain are read against.\n"
"Under Polarization in this window select Vertical or Horizontal; Total, "
"Right Hand, and Left Hand do not use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Vertikal va gorizontal kuchaytirish oʻqiladigan tayanchni tanlang.\n"
"Ushbu oynadagi Polarization ostida Vertical yoki Horizontal-ni tanlang; "
"Total, Right Hand va Left Hand bu sozlamadan foydalanmaydi."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:104
msgid ""
"Start advancing the animation phase at the cadence set below.\n"
"Nothing drawn now changes with phase. Under Display choose Currents or "
"Charges and an Animated colour or segment scale; for patches choose Currents "
"and an Animated flow mode. For NE/NH cards show Near Field and tick E, H, or "
"Poynting; for an RP card show Gain and tick Far Field."
msgstr ""
"Quyida belgilangan chastotada animatsiya fazasini ilgarilashni boshlang.\n"
"Hozir chizilgan hech narsa faza bilan oʻzgarmaydi. Display ostida Currents "
"yoki Charges va Animatsiyali rang yoki segment masshtabini tanlang; patchlar "
"uchun Currents va Animatsiyali oqim rejimini tanlang. NE/NH kartalari uchun "
"Near Field-ni koʻrsating va E, H yoki Poynting-ni belgilang; RP kartasi "
"uchun Gain-ni koʻrsating va Far Field-ni belgilang."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:115
msgid ""
"Start advancing the animation phase at the cadence set below.\n"
"Available when drawn content changes with phase."
msgstr ""
"Quyida oʻrnatilgan tezlikda animatsiya fazasini siljitishni boshlaydi.\n"
"Chizilgan tarkib faza bilan oʻzgarganda mavjud."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:119
msgid ""
"Select how the animated patch current flow is rendered.\n"
"Mirrors the Visualization menu setting in the main window."
msgstr ""
"Animatsiyalangan patch tok oqimi qanday koʻrsatilishini tanlang.\n"
"Asosiy oynadagi Vizualizatsiya menyusi sozlamasini aks ettiradi."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:123
msgid ""
"Resolve the far-zone field into tangent vectors drawn on the radiation "
"pattern gain surface.\n"
"Available while the radiation pattern window is open and Far Field is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Uzoq maydonni nurlanish diagrammasi kuchaytirish yuzasida chizilgan urinma "
"vektorlarga ajratadi.\n"
"Nurlanish diagrammasi oynasi ochiq va Uzoq maydon tanlanganda mavjud."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:129
msgid ""
"Read the vertical and horizontal gain selections against the spherical "
"basis, so vertical is the theta direction and horizontal is the phi "
"direction.\n"
"Available for Vertical or Horizontal polarization."
msgstr ""
"Vertikal va gorizontal kuchaytirish tanlovlarini sferik bazisga nisbatan "
"oʻqiydi, bunda vertikal — θ yoʻnalishi, gorizontal esa — φ yoʻnalishi.\n"
"Vertikal yoki Gorizontal qutblanish uchun mavjud."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:135
msgid ""
"Read the vertical and horizontal gain selections against the Ludwig-3 co-"
"polar and cross-polar directions, which hold one orientation across the "
"whole pattern.\n"
"Available for Vertical or Horizontal polarization."
msgstr ""
"Vertikal va gorizontal kuchaytirish tanlovlarini butun diagramma boʻylab "
"bitta yoʻnalishni saqlaydigan Ludwig-3 ko-polyar va kross-polyar "
"yoʻnalishlariga nisbatan oʻqiydi.\n"
"Vertikal yoki Gorizontal qutblanish uchun mavjud."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:141
msgid ""
"Draw the near electric field as vectors advancing with the animation phase.\n"
"Mirrors the Near E Field selection in the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Yaqin elektr maydonini animatsiya fazasiga mos ravishda siljiydigan "
"vektorlar sifatida chizadi.\n"
"Nurlanish diagrammasi oynasidagi Yaqin E maydoni tanlovini kuzatib boradi."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:147
msgid ""
"Draw the near magnetic field as vectors advancing with the animation phase.\n"
"Mirrors the Near H Field selection in the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Yaqin magnit maydonini animatsiya fazasiga mos ravishda siljiydigan "
"vektorlar sifatida chizadi.\n"
"Nurlanish diagrammasi oynasidagi Yaqin H maydoni tanlovini kuzatib boradi."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:153
msgid ""
"Draw the Poynting power flow as vectors advancing with the animation phase.\n"
"Mirrors the Poynting Vector selection in the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Poynting quvvat oqimini animatsiya fazasiga mos ravishda siljiydigan "
"vektorlar sifatida chizadi.\n"
"Nurlanish diagrammasi oynasidagi Poynting vektori tanlovini kuzatib boradi."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:205
msgid "Open the animation controls for phase-varying content."
msgstr "Fazasi oʻzgaruvchi tarkib uchun animatsiya boshqaruvlarini oching."

#: src/anim/anim_dialog.c:206
msgid ""
"Open the animation controls for phase-varying content.\n"
"This model has nothing to animate: load a NEC input file carrying wire cards "
"(GW, GA, GH), patch cards (SP, SC, SM), near-field cards (NE, NH), or a "
"radiation pattern card (RP)."
msgstr ""
"Faza boʻyicha oʻzgaruvchi kontent uchun animatsiya boshqaruvlarini oching.\n"
"Bu modelda animatsiya qilinadigan hech narsa yoʻq: sim kartalari (GW, GA, "
"GH), patch kartalari (SP, SC, SM), yaqin maydon kartalari (NE, NH) yoki "
"nurlanish diagrammasi kartasi (RP) boʻlgan NEC kirish faylini yuklang."

